        "language": "english",
        "review": "My favorite part of the game is the soft, bouncy jumps with mid-air twirls — pure joy in motion.  \nA soft story about a soft rabbit, softly hopping across a hard planet.\nEach level feels like cosmic poetry: a self-contained mini-universe with its own mood, physics, and hidden Easter eggs.  \nThe music and sound design are absolute masterpieces — chiptune melodies, the whisper of cosmic dust, the cheerful *\"fwip!\"* of a perfect hop. You’ll want to play without headphones, just to hear the world come alive around you.  \nThe game gently reminds us: even the tiniest bunny can explore the galaxy — as long as they know how to *flop* with love.  \nLet’s *flop* straight into the sequel!",
